.TH DUDES-CONTROL-CENTER 7 2026-11-22 "Dudes Control Center @VERSION@" "Dudes Control Center"
.nh
.SH NAME
dudes-control-center \- fan, CPU and keyboard backlight control for Clevo notebooks
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dudes Control Center controls the fans, the CPU frequency and the per-key RGB
keyboard backlight of Clevo notebooks (tested on the Clevo X58xWNx).
It consists of three root daemons, a GTK3 desktop application, three
command line tools and a kernel driver for the keyboard controller.
.PP
.B Warning:
the software writes to the embedded controller (EC) and to CPU frequency
settings.
It comes without any warranty; wrong fan settings can overheat the hardware.
.SS Components
.TP
.BR dcc-gui (1)
Desktop application with the tabs Status, Fan, CPU, Keyboard, Settings, Logs,
Help and About, and a tray icon.
.TP
.BR dcc-fan-cli (1)
Show temperatures and fan speeds, set a fixed fan speed, change the fan
daemon's log level.
.TP
.BR dcc-cpu-cli (1)
Show the CPU state, apply CPU profiles, set the governor and the hard
frequency limit.
.TP
.BR dcc-kbd-cli (1)
Switch the keyboard backlight on or off, set brightness and color, activate
keyboard profiles.
.TP
.BR dcc-fan-daemon (8)
Fan control along the active fan curve, with watchdog and temperature
fail-safes.
.TP
.BR dcc-cpu-daemon (8)
CPU governor, frequency profiles and the hard frequency limit, plus the
.B dcc-hard-limit-enforcer
timer.
.TP
.BR dcc-kbd-daemon (8)
Keyboard backlight: profiles with a base color and named zones, brightness,
on/off state across reboots.
.TP
.BR dcc-component (8)
Root helper that switches the fan, CPU or keyboard part on or off (used by the
Settings tab through
.BR pkexec (1)).
.TP
.B ite_829x
DKMS kernel module for the ITE 829x keyboard controller; it provides the LEDs
.I rgb:kbd_backlight*
under
.IR /sys/class/leds .
.TP
.BR dcc_fan (4)
DKMS kernel module for fans and temperatures on Clevo notebooks: EC access
through the kernel, the real fan duty through Clevo WMI, a watchdog; used by
the fan daemon and CLI when loaded.
.SS Access
The daemons listen on Unix sockets in
.IR /run .
Only root and members of the group
.B dudes-control-center
may send commands; the package adds the installing desktop user to it.
After being added, log out and in again.
To add another user:
.PP
.RS
.B sudo usermod \-aG dudes\-control\-center
.I user
.RE
.SS Profiles
Fan curves, CPU profiles with the hard limit and keyboard profiles are stored
in the desktop user's
.IR ~/.config/dudes-control-center/profiles.json .
The root daemons find that file in this order: the environment variable
.BR DCC_PROFILES_PATH ,
the user named in
.IR /etc/dudes-control-center/user ,
the first member of the group
.BR dudes-control-center ,
the user with uid 1000.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dudes-control-center/profiles.json
Fan, CPU and keyboard profiles.
.TP
.I ~/.config/dudes-control-center/config.json
GUI settings (language, appearance, visible components).
.TP
.I ~/.config/dudes-control-center/keyboard_led_mapping_<layout>.csv
Key-to-LED mapping from the LED wizard, per keyboard layout.
.TP
.I /etc/dudes-control-center/
.I user
(whose profiles the daemons read) and the
.IR disabled- <component>
flags written by
.BR dcc-component (8).
.TP
.I /var/log/dudes-control-center/
Daemon logs: FAN_DAEMON.log, CPU_DAEMON.log, KBD_BACKLIGHT_DAEMON.log,
HARD_LIMIT_ENFORCER.log.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/dudes-control-center/logs/GUI.log
Log of the desktop application.
.TP
.I /usr/share/dudes-control-center/layouts/
Keyboard layouts (de, uk, es, jp, kr): key positions and pictures.
.SH SEE ALSO
